	      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
	    (property "Description" "MinMax MCWI03-12D15: isolated 3W DC-DC, 12V input family (4.5-18V), dual +-15V/100mA output. Reused from the original NEWDAC Eagle design (net \"15V\" fed both this module and the LM1117 regulators). Pinout per MCWI03 datasheet dual-output table: 1=-Vin 2=+Vin 3=Remote On/Off 5=NC 6=+Vout 7=Common 8=-Vout. No footprint set: no exact match in KiCad libraries, needs a custom SIP-8 THT footprint (21.8x9.3mm body, 2.54mm pin pitch, single row, pin 4 physically absent) before fab." (at 0 0 0)
	      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
